L<Perl CodeMap on MetaCPAN|https://metacpan.org/dist/Perl-CodeMap>,
L<Live sample|https://interrupt21h.github.io/perl-codemap/>,
L<Source and issues|https://github.com/interrupt21h/perl-codemap>.

